        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This towering stone automaton bears the likeness of an archaic, armored warrior. It moves with ponderous but inexorable steps.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 26, touch 8; flat-footed 26 (-1 dex, +18 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 107 (14d10+30)</p><p>Fort +4, Ref +3, Will +9</p><p>DR 10/adamantine</p><p>Immune construct traits, Earth</p><p>Resist Fire 10, Lightning 10, Water 5</p><p>SR 22</p><p>Weakness Ice</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft.</p><p>Melee 2 Slams +22 (2d10+9 plus slow)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Earthquake, Haste, Rock Throw, Slow (DC 22 Fort save)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 28, Dex 9, Con -, Int -, Wis 20, Cha 1</p><p>Base Atk +14; CMB +24; CMD 33 (38 vs trip)</p>"
